1
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,380
Stay tuned!

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,470
- Sorry to keep you waiting.
- This looks delicious.

3
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,240
Minato...

4
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:36,330
I...

5
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,080
I'm really glad
I got to talk with you, Kaede-san.

6
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:40,960
Same here.

7
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:41,690
Thank you.

8
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:42,730
Don't mention it.

9
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:44,330
Huh?

10
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,420
What's wrong? Are you okay?

11
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,170
It's nothing...

12
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:49,340
It's usually hanging here...

13
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,840
My charm...

14
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:53,470
Did you drop it at the shop?

15
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:54,720
Should we call and ask?

16
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:56,140
No, it's fine.

17
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:58,480
I'll go look for it.

18
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:00,230
But they must be closed by now.

19
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:02,150
I'll stop by and ask for you
when I pass by tomorrow.

20
00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:04,360
No, that won't do.

21
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:06,230
That...

22
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:08,360
I can't lose that one...!

23
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:10,200
Wait... calm down.

24
00:01:11,490 --> 00:01:12,490
Watch out!!
